 "description": "See how declared response statuses changed per operation, and which operations are missing the statuses you require. Reports statuses added and removed, operations declaring no 2xx response at all, and responses with no description. Useful when a client has exhaustive error handling that a silently added status will fall through. Pay 90000 atomic USDC on Base via exact x402. MCP does not pay; it provides a challenge handoff.",
